{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "definitions": [
    {
      "id": "base:event_accept_event01_supervisor_priority",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "EVENT01验收·主管优先事件",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_supervisor",
      "priority": 100,
      "topicText": "验收·重要事情",
      "once": true,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "supervisor_priority",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "supervisor_priority",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「先等等。有件重要的事，必须先说清楚。」\n\n【EVENT-01 验收】第一次与主管交谈时，这段 Priority 100 内容应当直接出现，并压住所有 Priority 50 验收话题。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ack",
              "text": "知道了。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "acceptance:event01_priority_done"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_accept_event01_supervisor_topic_work",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "EVENT01验收·主管多步骤话题",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_supervisor",
      "priority": 50,
      "topicText": "验收·询问今日差事",
      "once": true,
      "onceScope": "perActorTarget",
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "ask",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「你又来找我做什么？」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ask_work",
              "text": "询问今日差事",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "player_work"
            },
            {
              "id": "show_qi",
              "text": "展示炼气境的手段",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "realmAtLeast",
                  "realm": "QiRefining"
                }
              ],
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": "需要队伍中至少一名存活成员达到炼气境",
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "player_qi"
            },
            {
              "id": "secret_foundation",
              "text": "提及只有筑基修士才知道的隐秘",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "realmAtLeast",
                  "realm": "Foundation"
                }
              ],
              "unavailableMode": "hidden",
              "requirementText": "需要队伍中至少一名存活成员达到筑基境",
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "player_foundation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "player_work",
          "speakerRef": "@actor",
          "text": "“我想问问今日还有什么差事。”",
          "nextStepId": "reply_work",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_work",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「该做什么就做什么。别误了时辰。」",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "acceptance:event01_multistep_done"
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_qi",
          "speakerRef": "@actor",
          "text": "“我已经不是从前那个只能听命干活的人了。”",
          "nextStepId": "reply_qi",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_qi",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "主管重新打量了你一眼，没有立刻接话。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_foundation",
          "speakerRef": "@actor",
          "text": "“有些事情，我知道得比你想象中更多。”",
          "nextStepId": "reply_foundation",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_foundation",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "主管神色微变，却没有继续追问。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_accept_event01_supervisor_topic_personal",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "EVENT01验收·主管第二话题",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_supervisor",
      "priority": 50,
      "topicText": "验收·问点私事",
      "once": true,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "start",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「私事？你什么时候也开始关心这些了？」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "没什么，只是随口问问。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "player_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "player_leave",
          "speakerRef": "@actor",
          "text": "“没什么，只是随口问问。”",
          "nextStepId": "finish",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "finish",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「没事就去做你的事。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_accept_event01_mansion_mark",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "EVENT01验收·议政厅刻痕",
      "trigger": "onInspect",
      "worldObjectKind": "controlCore",
      "worldObjectId": "base:workarea_supervisor_mansion",
      "priority": 50,
      "topicText": "查看墙角刻痕",
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "inspect",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "你走近议政厅仔细查看，在墙角发现一道已经风化的旧刻痕。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "look_closer",
              "text": "仔细看看",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "acceptance:event01_mansion_mark_seen"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "detail"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "detail",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "刻痕本身并没有什么力量，更像是很久以前有人随手留下的痕迹。\n\n【EVENT-01 验收】这里确认 WorldObject Inspect、旁白 Step 与 Outcome 正常。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_accept_event01_mansion_structure",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "EVENT01验收·议政厅结构",
      "trigger": "onInspect",
      "worldObjectKind": "controlCore",
      "worldObjectId": "base:workarea_supervisor_mansion",
      "priority": 50,
      "topicText": "观察议政厅结构",
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "inspect",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "你绕着议政厅看了一圈。这里既是荒村的议事地点，也是当前控制核心。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
